{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/directions-issued-to-bournemouth-christchurch-and-poole-council-april-2022","content_id":"17fd8eb4-fbe6-433d-9120-a6a5db651acf","description":"Statutory directions issued due to poor performance in children's social care services (now revoked) and inadequate improvement in SEND services.","details":{"attachments":[{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternative.formats@education.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"62503cacd3bf7f6006f84684","filename":"Bournemouth__Christchurch_and_Poole_Statutory_Direction.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":139765,"filename":"Bournemouth__Christchurch_and_Poole_Statutory_Direction.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9382849","isbn":"","number_of_pages":3,"title":"Bournemouth, Christchurch and Poole children's services statutory direction: revoked","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/62503cacd3bf7f6006f84684/Bournemouth__Christchurch_and_Poole_Statutory_Direction.pdf"},{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternative.formats@education.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"65dc7289964ca80011c6e8d4","filename":"SEND_Statutory_Direction_Bournemouth_Christchurch_and_Poole_childrens_services.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":153473,"filename":"SEND_Statutory_Direction_Bournemouth_Christchurch_and_Poole_childrens_services.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9382850","isbn":"","number_of_pages":4,"title":"Bournemouth, Christchurch and Poole SEND services statutory direction: revoked","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/65dc7289964ca80011c6e8d4/SEND_Statutory_Direction_Bournemouth_Christchurch_and_Poole_childrens_services.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><div class=\"call-to-action\">\n  <p>The children’s services statutory direction has been revoked following an <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://reports.ofsted.gov.uk/provider/44/2532287\">Ofsted inspection in December 2024</a>, and is no longer in force.</p>\n\n  <p>The SEND services statutory direction has been revoked. An <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/improvement-notice-issued-to-bournemouth-christchurch-and-poole-council-april-2026\">improvement notice issued by the Department for Education on 15 April 2026</a> replaces it.</p>\n</div>\n\n<p>The children’s social care services direction requires Bournemouth, Christchurch and Poole Council to take steps to improve its services. This includes co-operating with the Department for Education’s appointed adviser, operating under an expanded mandate to support the council’s corporate leadership team. It follows a <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://reports.ofsted.gov.uk/provider/44/2532287\">report by Ofsted</a> (December 2021) that judged the overall effectiveness of Bournemouth, Christchurch and Poole’s services to be inadequate.</p>\n\n<p>The statutory direction for SEND requires the council to take steps to improve its SEND services, including co-operating with the children’s and SEND services strategic improvement advisor, John Coughlan. This direction follows the 2021 joint <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://reports.ofsted.gov.uk/provider/44/2532287\">Ofsted and Care Quality Commission SEND report</a> and the lack of improvement for children and young people with SEND in the local area.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"The SEND services statutory direction has been revoked. Updated with a link to an improvement notice issued to Bournemouth, Christchurch and Poole Council in April 2026.\r\n","public_timestamp":"2026-07-09T08:30:14Z"},{"note":"The children's services statutory direction has been revoked. The SEND services statutory direction remains in place.","public_timestamp":"2025-03-25T16:21:25Z"},{"note":"Added 'Bournemouth, Christchurch and Poole SEND services statutory direction' and included information in the Details section to reflect this update.","public_timestamp":"2024-02-26T16:00:06Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2022-04-10T23:00:00Z"}],"document_type_label":"Correspondence","emphasised_organisations":["ebd15ade-73b2-4eaf-b1c3-43034a42eb37"],"featured_attachments":["9382849","9382850"],"first_public_at":"2022-04-11T00:00:00.000+01:00","national_applicability":{"england":{"applicable":true,"label":"England"},"northern_ireland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Northern Ireland"},"scotland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Scotland"},"wales":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Wales"}},"political":false,"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"correspondence","first_published_at":"2022-04-11T00:00:00+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/directions-issued-to-bournemouth-christchurch-and-poole-council-april-2022","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/publications/directions-issued-to-bournemouth-christchurch-and-poole-council-april-2022","base_path":"/government/publications/directions-issued-to-bournemouth-christchurch-and-poole-council-april-2022","content_id":"17fd8eb4-fbe6-433d-9120-a6a5db651acf","document_type":"correspondence","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-07-09T08:30:14Z","schema_name":"publication","title":"Directions issued to Bournemouth, Christchurch and Poole Council:  April 2022","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/directions-issued-to-bournemouth-christchurch-and-poole-council-april-2022","withdrawn":false}],"document_collections":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/collections/improvement-notices","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/collections/improvement-notices","base_